OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 28 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,5,     FMiles Beyond
OL,6,     GJournalist Kevin Le Gendre
OL,7,     Gexplores how Miles Davis's image
OL,8,     Gevolved alongside his music, and
OL,9,     Gbecame a fashion icon.
OL,10,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,11,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Geverything in between.
OL,16,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,17,     GSoweto's fourth and final guest
OL,18,     Gof the week, trumpeter, vocalist
OL,19,     Gand producer Emma-Jean Thackray,
OL,20,     Gpays homage to Miles Davis
OL,21,     Gthrough three albums that she
OL,22,     Gdeeply appreciates.
